    61	   | exact library and version | `cryptography` and its bundled OpenSSL, identified by wheel tag and native-library SHA-256 | same |
    62	   | accepted signature encodings | OpenPGP v4 packet; MPI rules; r, s ∈ [1, n−1]; rule-O policy | exact 3309 bytes; strict hint and z encoding |
    63	   | public-key validation | exact uncompressed point; coordinates < p; on the curve; checked before the library | exact SPKI; no algebraic validation exists |
    64	   | low-order-point handling | cofactor 1: infinity rejected as a key and as the equation's result; invalid-curve points rejected | no referent. Replaced by: degenerate-key behaviour recorded |
    65	   | cofactor equation variant | cofactor 1: a single variant; x(R) reduced mod n | no referent. Replaced by: the FIPS 204 interface (pure, empty context), with every other interface rejected |
    66	   | negative vectors for each | owner vectors plus Wycheproof | owner vectors plus Wycheproof |
